# PERMANENT REDIRECTS. The companion tools moved to bluhonei.com/tools/
# (Bluhonei/web, public/tools/). These old bluhonei-tools.netlify.app URLs
# are printed in published YouTube videos and emails, so this Netlify site
# must stay up forever as a redirect layer. Never delete the Netlify site,
# and never remove these rules.
#
# "301!" = permanent redirect, forced. The tool files still exist in this
# repo, and without "!" Netlify would serve the file instead of
# redirecting. Every rule points at the final URL, so each old link is one
# hop. Rules are matched top to bottom; first match wins.

# Root and the six tools
/                 https://bluhonei.com/tools/index.html      301!
/index.html       https://bluhonei.com/tools/index.html      301!
/scorecard.html   https://bluhonei.com/tools/scorecard.html  301!
/audit.html       https://bluhonei.com/tools/audit.html      301!
/summer.html      https://bluhonei.com/tools/summer.html     301!
/floor.html       https://bluhonei.com/tools/floor.html      301!
/policy.html      https://bluhonei.com/tools/policy.html     301!
# The same tools without .html, which Netlify also serves
/index            https://bluhonei.com/tools/index.html      301!
/scorecard        https://bluhonei.com/tools/scorecard.html  301!
/audit            https://bluhonei.com/tools/audit.html      301!
